                                "sense_id": "2f75e50c-04db-397d-a2e8-5cb3789dba78",
                                "text": "[…] Oscar has been called the Voldemort of Fleet Street by both friends and enemies. He was apparently ruthless in all his business dealings.'"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "db7e6ff6-27c8-4ae2-8d7e-befd4a9b4c7a",
                                "sense_id": "2f75e50c-04db-397d-a2e8-5cb3789dba78",
                                "text": "If you asked me to identify a Voldemort in the myth of “social media,” it would be these people, and not guys like Gary Vaynerchuk."
                            },
                            {
